<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f6f8; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
    .card { background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #e1e4e8; }
    h2 { color: #dd6b20; }
    p { color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.6; }
    .highlight { background: #feebc8; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: bold; color: #7b341e; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h2>Task Deadline Reminder</h2>
    <p>Hello {{recipientName}},</p>
    <p>This is a friendly reminder that your task <strong>{{taskTitle}}</strong> is due soon.</p>
    <p class="highlight">Due Date: {{dueDate}}</p>
    <p>Please make sure to complete your task on time.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
